  "details": "<p>The <em>Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Umbrian people.\u00a0</p>\r\n<p><span>According to G. Uggeri writing for\u00a0</span><em>New Pauly\u00a0</em><span>this group was, in 266 B.C., deported to Umbria from Soletum in Calabria.</span></p>",
